<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine May inflation flat at 0.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Ukraine May inflation flat at 0.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's consumer price inflation in May remained unchanged from April at 0.8 percent, the Ministry of Economy said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Ministry of Statistics is expected to release official inflation figures this week.</p>
<p>Ukraine has forecast annual inflation at 25 percent in 1997, compared to 39.7 percent last year.</p>
<p>--Irene Marushko, Kiev Newsroom +380 44 244-9150</p>
